# mod-custom-spells: 901004 (spell damage takes 1 s off Starfall's cooldown) for a druid below level 80
# (player report 2026-10-29: a level-53 druid with Starfall rank 1, 48505 - "the starfall refresh thingy is
# not working"). The code reduced the top rank 53201 only. Here the bot knows rank 1 alone; as in
# cs_druid.tbs, a Starfall (90 s), then 4 Moonfires: natively 83 s are left after 6.9 s.
# Test ground: map 13, the FL dummy arena (AoE Training Dummies 920018).
name    Custom spells - Starfall cooldown reduction on Starfall rank 1
timeout 60s

bot dr druid slot=4

place 13 -279 150 -423.2 0
require dr alive
pick d1 creature:920018 near dr
require d1 exists
do gm target dr
as gm .unlearn 53201
as gm .unlearn 901004
do dr learn 48505
do dr learn 48463
do dr learn 901004
do dr cast 48505
wait 1600ms
do dr cast 48463 on d1
wait 1600ms
do dr cast 48463 on d1
wait 1600ms
do dr cast 48463 on d1
wait 1600ms
do dr cast 48463 on d1
wait 500ms
expect dr cooldown 48505 < 81000

cleanup
do dr stop
do gm target dr
as gm .unaura 48505
as gm .unlearn 901004
as gm .unlearn 48505
do dr learn 53201
